  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Improving PCRWR Research Infrastructure and Enhancing Integrated Water Resources Management Capacity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance water resource management capabilities through digitized research infrastructure, ensuring the long-term sustainability of water resources in response to climate change&#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xb370;&#xc774;&#xd130; &#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xbc0f; &#xc5f0;&#xad6c; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;&#xc73c;&#xb85c; &#xacfc;&#xd559;&#xc801; &#xc815;&#xcc45; &#xc218;&#xb9bd; &#xbc0f; &#xc774;&#xd589;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening capacity to respond to climate-related water disasters, Strengthen Regional Water Quality Monitoring and install Real-Time Surface Water Quality Monitoring Systems, , Improve groundwater assessment methods for climate resilience through the Formulation of an Integrated Groundwater Management Master Plan, Develop a Groundwater Information Management System (GWMIS) and established a comprehensive water resources management information system, Enhance Professional Technical Capacity through specialized training program</narrative>
  </description>
